      "content": "Wait, you're saying it's \"crucial to support\" them? I'm just asking for the consequences. My concern is that these costs are going to put a lot of my neighbors out of business. Isn't it true that these regulations are basically just an unfair burden on smaller players compared to the big corporations?",
